{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266XZ94gmNGw1794536487.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連升兩天，見逾一周高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7152，較上個交易日上調22點子，是自11月3日以來的高位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價早段都於6.67水平上落。另外人民銀行開展3,640億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，以及3,000億元人民幣7天期逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放2,800億元人民幣。全周計算，淨投放4,380億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:54:25.727846+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:20:39.945290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:47:47.219981+00:00","content_hash":"0074b43241e03b6608a99ec515c74c4277a39e23ae8d9d3aef96d8589552e040","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:54:25.727846+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}